@Agency.Api_HostAddress = https://localhost:7122

GET {{Agency.Api_HostAddress}}/api/agencies
Accept: application/json

### Crear Agencia con reglas dinámicas

POST {{Agency.Api_HostAddress}}/api/agencies
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "name": "Agencia Viajes El Sol",
  "contactEmail": "contacto@viajeselsol.com",
  "commissionRules": [
    {
      "destinationCategory": "Aventura",
      "percentage": 0.15
    },
    {
      "destinationCategory": "Relax",
      "percentage": 0.10
    }
  ]
}

